{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/139905-wraith-s-perception-of-a-demon","id":139905,"title":"Wraith's perception of a Demon?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Wraith: The Oblivion"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-05-16T15:56:25-07:00","id":139905,"title":"Wraith's perception of a Demon?","content":"How might a demon's presence in the Skinlands be perceived by a nearby wraith?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#800000\"><b>Demon Cat</b></span><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://flamingporcupine.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Illuminated Dark Ages character sheets and more</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10-demon-cat","name":"Demon Cat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"266"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-16T18:10:34-07:00","id":140098,"title":"","content":"i always imagined that something deep within the wraith would make him very weary and even ragefull against the demon. Specially against Slayers","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-16T19:19:17-07:00","id":140152,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:courier new, courier, monospace\">Off the top of my head:</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:courier new, courier, monospace\">I think a wraith might perceive a demon (while said wraith is in the Skinlands) based on the demon\u2019s Torment; a wraith might see a shadow/silhouette of a low-Torment demon\u2019s Apocalyptic Form, while a high-Torment demon might appear (to the wraith) as its Apocalyptic Form. </span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:courier new, courier, monospace\">Also a few considerations/questions for determining precedents:</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:courier new, courier, monospace\">How liberal the ST is with interpretations of Deathsight.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:courier new, courier, monospace\">Has the presence of Angelics and Demonics (from </span><i>Sea of Shadows</i><span style=\"font-family:courier new, courier, monospace\">) been used in the chronicle and/or resolved with DtF?</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:courier new, courier, monospace\">Can wraiths see changelings\u2019 fae miens?</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:courier new, courier, monospace\">How do wraiths see Fomori (ones that look relatively normal)? </span><br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:8px\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">&lt;signature&gt; something witty &lt;/signature&gt;</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/302-nazfool","name":"Nazfool","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar302_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"753"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-16T20:28:12-07:00","id":140187,"title":"","content":"This is a VtM chronicle. All of the non-vampires are NPCs, but they all have their agendas. I've been running both the ghosts and the demon in a very loose manner since we're outside their splats. Changelings are not involved. I don't even know what Fomori are, so they certainly aren't a factor.<br /> <br /> Most of the demon stuff has come from the open-dev draft of Rites of the Blood (new VtM book, looking forward to its release). There's a PC who's haunted, which makes for a fun way to introduce arbitrary information to her. The ghosts she speaks with were present recently when another character made use of a Demonic Investment. Basically, he activated a supernatural power that was granted by a demon, though he is not one himself. This shows as wonky-looking with Aura Sight, so I figured that the Wraithly perspective would be interesting as well. <br /> <br /> The demon itself was present when this happened, but wasn't doing anything besides watching. It might have been in a position relative to the ghosts such that they could see each other, or they could simply have felt a presence. <br /> <br /> The demon isn't fully stat'd. It simply saw an attractive mark, and is stringing him along in the hopes of manipulating him to ever more desirable ends. He already sacrificed an innocent to it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#800000\"><b>Demon Cat</b></span><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://flamingporcupine.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Illuminated Dark Ages character sheets and more</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10-demon-cat","name":"Demon Cat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"266"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-16T20:47:06-07:00","id":140197,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:courier new\">I would be inclined to go with the aforementioned more/less distinct Apoc Form 'shadow' based on the demon's Torment. However, it sounds like going that route might give the haunted PC a bit more insight than you might be comfortable with. I haven't seen what's on the slab for RotB, but I'm guessing things like &quot;Torment&quot; (a trait from DtF) aren't brought up; maybe the wraith sees a kewl bat-wing-balrog-esque-shadow-aura-thing from the demon? It's kinda of demony, kinda weird, and doesn't get [too] entangled with crossover complications.<br /> <br /> In regards to changelings (and fomori), I was more curious what sort of precedents you've set for what wraiths see from 'possessed' individuals. Whatever chronicle-rulings you've made in regards to those subjects might be inferred towards demons. </span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:8px\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">&lt;signature&gt; something witty &lt;/signature&gt;</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/302-nazfool","name":"Nazfool","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar302_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"753"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-16T20:55:03-07:00","id":140205,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nazfool</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/139905-wraith-s-perception-of-a-demon?p=140197#post140197\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"font-family:courier new\">I would be inclined to go with the aforementioned more/less distinct Apoc Form 'shadow' based on the demon's Torment. However, it sounds like going that route might give the haunted PC a bit more insight than you might be comfortable with. I haven't seen what's on the slab for RotB, but I'm guessing things like &quot;Torment&quot; (a trait from DtF) aren't brought up; maybe the wraith sees a kewl bat-wing-balrog-esque-shadow-aura-thing from the demon? It's kinda of demony, kinda weird, and doesn't get [too] entangled with crossover complications.</span></div> </div> </div> </div>Cool. I think a mix of a half-seen thing of that description, and weary, &quot;off&quot; feeling like Crowly mentioned will be good.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nazfool</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/139905-wraith-s-perception-of-a-demon?p=140197#post140197\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"font-family:courier new\">In regards to changelings (and fomori), I was more curious what sort of precedents you've set for what wraiths see from 'possessed' individuals. Whatever chronicle-rulings you've made in regards to those subjects might be inferred towards demons. </span></div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, makes sense.<br /> <br /> Thanks for the input guys!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#800000\"><b>Demon Cat</b></span><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://flamingporcupine.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Illuminated Dark Ages character sheets and more</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10-demon-cat","name":"Demon Cat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"266"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}